#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:5
#: 0e941921568e4ab99907281e84641704
msgid "Yahboom Balance Bot"
msgstr "Yahboom 平衡机器人"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:11
#: d9fc26cfddc343b1843f1a6bef751ca6
msgid ""
"This build is based on the `Yahboom Balance Bot "
"<http://category.yahboom.net/products/sbr-chassis-"
"kit?variant=50227273072956>`__ chassis."
msgstr ""
"本构建基于 `Yahboom Balance Bot <http://category.yahboom.net/products/sbr-"
"chassis-kit?variant=50227273072956>`__ 底盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:13
#: 1e223238d4634ef189e8e8e2a08451bc
msgid ""
"The chassis comes with motors, wheel encoders and just enough room to fit a "
"flight controller and a motor driver."
msgstr "该底盘自带电机和轮式编码器，其内部空间恰好可容纳一个飞控和一个电机驱动器。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:15
#: 797d15ef2d134bfd98c1082a093c799a
msgid ""
"A complete build log is available on the ArduPilot forum here: `Yahboom "
"Balance Bot Build Log <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/yahboom-balancebot-"
"build-log>`__"
msgstr ""
"完整的构建日志可在 ArduPilot 论坛查阅：`Yahboom Balance Bot Build Log "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/yahboom-balancebot-build-log>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:18
#: 9ed482826fed47069f2a63d9264fbe97
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:20
#: 7a83e7fb69a64a448c7bc31726430109
msgid ""
"`Yahboom Chassis Kit <http://category.yahboom.net/products/sbr-chassis-"
"kit?variant=50227273072956>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Yahboom 底盘套件 <http://category.yahboom.net/products/sbr-chassis-"
"kit?variant=50227273072956>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:21
#: b3812b858d4748e88838c79136851a8c
msgid ""
"Flight Controller + GPS. The flight controller must have 6x outputs - 2 for "
"motor control and 4 for wheel encoders."
msgstr "飞控 + GPS。飞控必须具有 6 个输出——2 个用于电机控制，4 个用于轮式编码器。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:22
#: 01c34c8071b34432af01761e10a067ac
msgid ""
"3S (12V) Battery. An `18650 battery holder <https://core-"
"electronics.com.au/3-x-18650-battery-holder-with-dc2-1-power-jack.html>`__ "
"fits well in the chassis."
msgstr ""
"3S（12V）电池。`18650 电池盒 <https://core-electronics.com.au/3-x-18650-battery-"
"holder-with-dc2-1-power-jack.html>`__ 可以很好地装入底盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:23
#: d57b37087f6e4f26a257571677d77f19
msgid "RC receiver"
msgstr "遥控接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:24
#: 7cd6aac02a2c4919b442b4f233d35b4d
msgid ""
"`Roboclaw 2x7A Motor controller <https://www.pololu.com/product/3284>`__"
msgstr "`Roboclaw 2x7A 电机控制器 <https://www.pololu.com/product/3284>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:27
#: e61d27fb5c3748b59afdc01a958195b4
msgid "Connection and Setup"
msgstr "连接与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:29
#: cb56e61c1779496296b4f11eef8f62eb
msgid "Setup the Roboclaw motor driver:"
msgstr "设置 Roboclaw 电机驱动器："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:31
#: 8a6ab1d5047546d68d145a2c5a9965f5
msgid "Download and install the BasicMicro Motion Studio software"
msgstr "下载并安装 BasicMicro Motion Studio 软件"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:32
#: 250c73afaacc421cbd224cdeaeb7ec71
msgid ""
"Connect the Roboclaw motor driver to your (Windows) PC with a USB cable. "
"Note a mandatory firmware update is required and requires a Windows (not a "
"VM) PC."
msgstr ""
"使用 USB 线将 Roboclaw 电机驱动器连接到您的（Windows）电脑。注意：必须进行一次强制固件更新，且需要一台 Windows "
"电脑（不能是虚拟机）。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:33
#: bd49179eed5a499486c8b51bd0bcaa78
msgid ""
"Connect with BasicMicro Motion Studio then on the General Settings page. Set"
" Control Mode = RC, disable Safe Start, Disable Auto Calibration."
msgstr ""
"使用 BasicMicro Motion Studio 连接，然后在 General Settings 页面中，将 Control Mode 设置为 "
"RC，禁用 Safe Start，并禁用 Auto Calibration。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:34
#: b5a41758cea2480f931b1e6b2db029c5
msgid "From the File menu, \"Save Setting\""
msgstr "通过「File」菜单，选择「Save Setting」"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:40
#: 24387d000c3c42f197c190a3cc5b4b3d
msgid ""
"Connect the yellow and white wires from the wheel encoders to the AUX OUT "
"3,4,5,6 pins as described on the :ref:`wheel encoder wiki page <wheel-"
"encoder>`"
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`轮速编码器 Wiki 页面 <wheel-encoder>` 的说明，将轮速编码器的黄色和白色导线连接到 AUX OUT "
"3、4、5、6 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:41
#: 4d6fb2e1d2e74cf5947361a86eede7ec
msgid "Connect the autopilot, motor driver and motors as shown below"
msgstr "按下图所示连接飞控、电机驱动器和电机"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:48
#: b39b9ba2f04f43a9beead38ec353f892
msgid "Driving"
msgstr "驾驶"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:50
#: 43b9227ac10947ae9bdf69f3d7ad5958
msgid ""
"The vehicle is stable up to 0.6m/s, but 0.5m/s is recommended for AUTO and "
"GUIDED modes."
msgstr "车辆在最高 0.6m/s 的速度下可保持稳定，但在 AUTO 和 GUIDED 模式下建议使用 0.5m/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-yahboom-balancebot.rst:52
#: 5b25439138c94c8a972b4878b0b8104a
msgid ""
"When driving up or down slopes, the vehicle is stable for slopes up to 12 "
"degrees. Beyond that, the vehicle may tip over."
msgstr "上下坡时，车辆在坡度不超过 12 度的情况下可保持稳定。超过该坡度，车辆可能会翻倒。"

